comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T19:02:04.414Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: fresh orientation, request-specific search, open/in-progress inventories and complete strict 3126-item all-status corpus found no open owner for this exact case. Full live metadata and histories of related owners confirm their completed, distinct scope. This is intake only, open and unclaimed; implementation is outside the current delivery cohort."
  "2026-10-26T22:06:42.210Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: the isolated native 251-entry control failed at physical index 1 before the change and now starts at 251. Every older entry resumes exactly once via SDK output cursors. Compact/provenance reads disclose order and matching total; explicit latest-N and full reads stay chronological. SDK verification still consumes the unmodified full chain. Focused cohort: 96 passed before final full-mode and diff transport controls. Full coverage and release/package validation are pending."
  "2026-10-26T22:28:27.197Z","harness:codex","Full-suite first pass completed 11478 passing tests and exposed two expected integration assertions for the new history order and total/order receipt fields, plus stale SDK snapshot and an installed-npm module-resolution setup failure. The setup issue did not demonstrate a timing regression: its long-running cursor test actually failed resolving npm/package.json. Preserve existing allocation and deadlines. Update the two assertions, regenerate the reviewed SDK surface before testing, and expose the installed npm module using NODE_PATH for the next complete run. Added all new recovery controls to the existing native Windows source cohort and its membership guard."
  "2026-10-26T22:35:18.893Z","harness:codex","The corrected nine-file targeted suite passes174 tests, including real packed Node and Bun SDK cursor traversal. Static checks rejected the enlarged history dispatcher complexity, so projection construction is extracted into a private SDK helper while keeping selection, counts, verification and version addresses unchanged. No quality limit is raised. Full coverage will rerun after static verification."
  "2026-10-26T22:49:08.856Z","harness:codex","Static verification passed lint, zero-clone profiles, permissions, dependency cooldown, contract/surface parity, package boundaries, refusal closure, token replay, MCP deprecation and tracker-context assurance. The SDK import-cost gate then failed its qualified Node 26 runner by 1 ms on the merge entrypoint (227 ms versus 226 ms). Preserve that failure and its unchanged limit; rerun the failing gate in isolation after coverage diagnostics, then complete the remaining transport/graph/record/mutation gates. The existing runner investigation remains distinct from this history change; no performance exception is added."
  "2026-10-26T23:06:10.807Z","harness:codex","Published-versus-checkout native acceptance: an independently installed npm 2026.10.26 artifact and the current checkout each create and verify a 251-entry non-Git timeline. Published default JSON returns 98 rows indexed 1..98 in 23901 bytes, losing the latest 153 entries. Current Node and Bun public-SDK consumers both return 98 rows indexed 251..154 with total=251 and order=newest_first in 23903 bytes. Explicit latest-five windows remain 247..251 in both versions (1493 published bytes,1536 current bytes). This proves corrected fact selection rather than a smaller default allocation. The current-consumer proof uses a public-entrypoint workspace link; independent packed Node/Bun cursor traversal already passes, with full packed executor acceptance still pending."
  "2026-10-26T23:58:42.566Z","harness:codex","Hosted acceptance for source head58e8f12264497c1411f29afd78d139b406231663: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/40420598204. Exact aggregate coverage has zero uncovered counts; native Windows regression and all packed first-run checks pass. The first static job fails solely active planner completeness on this delivery task (estimate and expected result); both fields were supplied through pm and local tracker-context assurance now passes. Full revised-head static/check/review acceptance is still mandatory before merge. Preserve the failed local coverage attempt and separate qualified Node26 admission failures; no overall-green claim is made for the first workflow. Fresh checkout history at23:35:08UTC has a Sentry pm.command trace and backend start/finish delivery0.581255/0.228834seconds. The measured current-installation window has82starts/82finishes and zero unequal groups; physical local queue and broker are empty after SDK flush. This does not replace the separate all-installation pairing investigation."
